:560px;">LED module assembly uses COB die attach, wire bonding and encapsulation processes from Hana's microelectronics operations, with thermal-interface requirements integrated for automotive lighting applications.</p><a href="/capabilities/microelectronic-assembly" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;">See Microelectronic Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div><div style="background:#071f35; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0;"><div style="max-width:976px; padding:0 48px;"><div class="auto-sechead on-dark"><h2>Where it&#39;s made</h2><p>LED lighting assembly is supported in Thailand, combining COB and SMT capability across two Hana plants.</p></div><div class="auto-plants" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);"><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/ayutthaya" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Thailand</span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/lamphun" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Thailand</span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); line-height:1.5; margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">View all locations &rarr;</a></p></div></div><div style="background:var(--bg); border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0 48px;"><div style="max-width:976px; padding:0 48px;"